#: SplitTrip/SplitTrip/settings.py:131 SplitTrip/SplitTrip/settings.py:141
msgid "Persian"
msgstr "فارسی"

#: SplitTrip/SplitTrip/settings.py:132 SplitTrip/SplitTrip/settings.py:142
